---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import { materials } from '@/data/product';
import { splitWords } from '@/lib/format';
import atmosphere from '@/assets/images/noir-atmosphere.jpg';

const statement =
  'Obsidian is what happens when lava cools too quickly to crystallise. We wanted a perfume that behaves the same way: dark, glassy, and caught in the moment before it settles.';
---

<section id="craft" class="craft" data-scene="craft" aria-labelledby="craft-title">
  <div class="wrap" data-landing>
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal-item>
      The Craft
    </p>
    <h2 class="craft-statement" id="craft-title" data-words>
      {splitWords(statement).map((word) => (
        <span data-word>{word} </span>
      ))}
    </h2>
    <figure class="craft-figure" data-craft-figure>
      <div class="craft-figure__inner" data-craft-parallax>
        <Picture
          src={atmosphere}
          widths={[640, 960, 1248]}
          sizes="(min-width: 92rem) 88rem, 92vw"
          formats={['avif', 'webp']}
          fallbackFormat="jpg"
          quality={88}
          loading="lazy"
          alt="The bottle standing in a dark chamber between two vertical blades of golden light."
        />
      </div>
    </figure>
    <div class="craft-layout">
      <div class="craft-story prose-quiet" data-reveal-item>
        <p>
          The house began with a single question and no storefront: how little can a perfume say and
          still be remembered? Nº 01 took the idea to its limit, with one formula, one bottle and
          one colour.
        </p>
        <p>
          Everything around the liquid was then taken away until only three materials remained. Open
          each one to see why it stayed.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="materials" data-reveal-item>
        {materials.map((material) => (
          <details class="material">
            <summary>
              <span>
                <span class="material__name">{material.name}</span>
                <span class="material__summary">{material.summary}</span>
              </span>
              <span class="material__marker" aria-hidden="true" />
            </summary>
            <p class="material__detail">{material.detail}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="craft-philosophy" data-reveal-item>
      <p class="eyebrow">Philosophy</p>
      <blockquote>
        Luxury is not the addition of more. It is the courage to leave the label blank.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
